  "description": "Follow-up from TASK-10.5 code review (doc-128). In src/stats/leak-categories.json: (1) the turn-fold fix says the pot 'has grown enough' to call while the turn-call justification says the doubled bet 'raises the required equity' \u2014 the accurate reason is that a draw has only one card to come; (2) the flop-call fix says your chance must 'beat' the price but the rule calls when it is at least the price; (3) the flop-bet fix promises a free turn after a check, which only holds when you act last.",
